  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad43bd934b591fe2cb6e443df01c7bb9, type: 3}
  m_Name: OldMan_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - I told you didn't I?
  - That I am kinda strong
  - You must be suprised hahaha...
  - Well we got another issue here
  - You see...
  - I always travel alone
  - Despite my wife asking me to bring her with me
  - But I refused.
  - The reason was that this boat could only carry 1 person at a time
  - I was a little cheap but whenever I come here
  - I often collect the orb which are easy to find in the mine
  - And after saving up, I finally saved enough to buy a big boat
  - But like I said, I can't carry you on this boat young soul
  - I know you helped me but, I guess you have to stay here
  - Ofcourse! I'll send in people I know
  - They will be active during the day to fish for food
  - And wait...
  - I totally forgot.
  - The sun is kinda shiny but still...
  - What time is it?
